  abilityDesc: 25 combo Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts Water elemental damage for 4 turns, boosts spark damage for 4 turns, boosts
    critical damage for 4 turns, boosts Atk, Def and critical rate for 4 turns &
    purges LS and ES Lock effects from all allies
